\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0626faf5263e31f8\" href=\"?note=0626faf5263e31f8\" title=\"17-df-omega-stability\">17-df-omega-stability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5772a390b9182440\" href=\"?note=5772a390b9182440\" title=\"17-df-language-constants\">17-df-language-constants</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-7.1.5b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span>；基数及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathfrak A,B}\">\\(T_{\\mathfrak A,B}\\)</span> 同时记录环境结构与参数集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c_b=\\operatorname{Name}_L(b)\">\\(c_b=\\operatorname{Name}_L(b)\\)</span>；该名字函数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"5772a390b9182440\" href=\"?note=5772a390b9182440\" title=\"17-df-language-constants\">17-df-language-constants</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})\">\\(S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(C_B)\">\\(L(C_B)\\)</span> 的语言实例解释，不是原语言的型空间。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}\">\\(\\operatorname{Complete}\\)</span> (theory-completeness predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"bd7acd1192e46962\" href=\"?note=bd7acd1192e46962\" title=\"17-df-theory-properties\">17-df-theory-properties</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\)</span> (models of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"53255a372e5c1ee8\" href=\"?note=53255a372e5c1ee8\" title=\"17-df-model\">17-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\\)</span> (nonlogical alphabet, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{\\mathfrak A,B}\">\\(T_{\\mathfrak A,B}\\)</span> (complete theory over parameters <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"6c973042c939008f\" href=\"?note=6c973042c939008f\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-saturation\">17-df-cardinal-saturation</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})\">\\(S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})\\)</span> (complete <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>-types over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"07adad8c036296f7\" href=\"?note=07adad8c036296f7\" title=\"17-df-type\">17-df-type</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Stable}_\\kappa,\\operatorname{StabSpec},\\kappa_{\\mathrm{st}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Stable}_\\kappa,\\operatorname{StabSpec},\\kappa_{\\mathrm{st}}\\)</span> (predicate, definable cardinal class, and partial ordinal-valued function defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Stable}_\\kappa(T)\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\n\\land|\\operatorname{Sym}(L)|\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\forall B\\subseteq|\\mathfrak{A}|\\;\n\\bigl(\n|B|\\leq\\kappa\n\\to\n|S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})|\\leq\\kappa\n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{StabSpec}(T)\n&amp;=\n\\{\\kappa:\\operatorname{Stable}_\\kappa(T)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{StabSpec}(T)\\neq\\varnothing\n&amp;\\longrightarrow\n\\kappa_{\\mathrm{st}}(T)\n=\n\\min\\operatorname{StabSpec}(T).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Stable}_\\kappa(T)\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\n\\land\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\n\\land|\\operatorname{Sym}(L)|\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\forall B\\subseteq|\\mathfrak{A}|\\;\n\\bigl(\n|B|\\leq\\kappa\n\\to\n|S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})|\\leq\\kappa\n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{StabSpec}(T)\n&amp;=\n\\{\\kappa:\\operatorname{Stable}_\\kappa(T)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{StabSpec}(T)\\neq\\varnothing\n&amp;\\longrightarrow\n\\kappa_{\\mathrm{st}}(T)\n=\n\\min\\operatorname{StabSpec}(T).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The stability spectrum is a definable class of infinite cardinals; its least element is a partial ordinal-valued class function. The previous name “Shelah's <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\aleph_\\varepsilon\\)</span>” was not supported by the\nassertion: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\aleph_\\varepsilon\\)</span> is not, in general, the minimum of a theory's\nstability spectrum.  This atom now names exactly the spectrum and its minimum\nwhen that minimum is defined.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-language-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"e8f9375543fc2e7d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"53255a372e5c1ee8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-type","status":"resolved","id":"07adad8c036296f7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-saturation","status":"resolved","id":"6c973042c939008f","