)\n\\land\\aleph_0\\leq\\kappa\n\\land|\\operatorname{Sym}(L)|\\leq\\kappa\\\\\n&\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak{A}\\in\\operatorname{Mod}(T)\\;\n\\forall B\\subseteq|\\mathfrak{A}|\\;\n\\bigl(\n|B|\\leq\\kappa\n\\to\n|S_1(T_{\\mathfrak A,B})|\\leq\\kappa\n\\bigr),\\\\\n\\operatorname{StabSpec}(T)\n&=\n\\{\\kappa:\\operatorname{Stable}_\\kappa(T)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{StabSpec}(T)\\neq\\varnothing\n&\\longrightarrow\n\\kappa_{\\mathrm{st}}(T)\n=\n\\min\\operatorname{StabSpec}(T).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\aleph_\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_\\varepsilon","display":false}],"bytes":2909,"backlinks":[{"id":"614f26d7353bc53d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Stable}_\\kappa$ ($\\kappa$-stability predicate, see [[17-df-stability-spectrum]])"},{"id":"29c30973fd2ffd89","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Stable}_\\kappa$ 见 [[17-df-stability-spectrum]]；$\\kappa$ 为无限基数，$2^{\\aleph_0}$ 为基数幂。"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-one-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-aleph-zero-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-assignment]]\n[[17-df-assignment-predicate]]\n[[17-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model]]\n[[17-df-atomic-model-notation]]\n[[17-df-bool-comb]]\n[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-expansion]]\n[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-saturation]]\n[[17-df-categoricity]]\n[[17-df-chain-union]]\n[[17-df-chain-union-preservation]]\n[[17-df-complete-formula]]\n[[17-df-deduction-system]]\n[[17-df-definable-closure]]\n[[17-df-definable-set]]\n[[17-df-dense-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-diagram]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-df-elementary-amalgamation-property]]\n[[1